sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend
    participant C as Checkout
    participant Cart
    participant PC as Product catalog
    participant Cur as Currency
    participant S as Shipping
    participant P as Payment
    participant E as Email
    participant K as orders (Kafka)

    F->>C: PlaceOrder
    C->>Cart: get the cart
    C->>PC: get each product
    C->>Cur: convert the prices
    C->>S: quote the shipping
    C->>P: charge the card
    C->>S: ship the order
    C->>Cart: empty the cart
    C->>E: send the confirmation
    C-)K: publish the order
    C-->>F: order placed
    K-)Accounting: store the order
    K-)Fraud detection: inspect the order
